@startuml
' Evaluation Dimensions Diagram (converted from Mermaid to PlantUML)

!theme plain

@startmindmap
* **Evaluation Dimensions**
** Intrinsic: Model-Centric
*** Perplexity
*** Calibration (ECE, Brier)
*** Efficiency Metrics (Latency, FLOPs)
** Extrinsic: Task-Centric
*** Automated Evaluation
**** Reference-Based Metrics
***** Traditional (BLEU, ROUGE, METEOR)
***** Neural (BERTScore, COMET, BLEURT)
**** Reference-Free (LLM-as-Judge)
***** G-Eval, Prometheus, GPTScore
*** Manual Evaluation
**** Individual Expert Assessment
***** Absolute Rating (Likert scales)
***** Comparative Judgment (A vs B, Rankings)
**** Multi-Rater Consensus Methods (NPS)
*** Hybrid Pipelines
**** Automated Screening + Manual Validation
** Meta-Evaluation: Cross-Cutting
*** Correlation to Human Judgment
*** Benchmark Contamination Audits
*** Robustness / Bias Studies
@endmindmap

@enduml
